{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act19side_level_act19side_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act19side",
  "stageId": "act19side_03",
  "title": "動力裝甲",
  "storyCode": "DV-3",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9bc15d72b15632675c365382a08eb018e579e29bdf8f9e2d2d96554f481bb15f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g8_alley_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "成分解析失敗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這銀色液體與任何已知的化合物都不匹配。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "白色結晶在她指尖凝結，迅速覆蓋了整隻手掌，直至半截小臂。\n你剛剛才親眼目睹了這一幕，過去也曾無數次在戰場上和作戰記錄裡見過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "鈣質化？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "有敵人嗎？！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "塞雷婭沒有回答你。\n她突然抬手，堅硬的拳頭瞬間逼近你的鼻尖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一聲磐石與金屬碰撞的銳響，你知道是Mechanist的機械臂替你擋下了這一擊。\n可你還來不及喘氣，就看到一道白光抵上了自己的咽喉。\n塞雷婭的一隻手的確被Mechanist擋下了，她的另一隻手也沒有動。\n但鈣質的利刃確實架在你的脖子上。\n你下意識屏住了呼吸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......塞雷婭，解釋你的行為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣更直觀些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的源石技藝能夠對周圍含有鈣元素的物質進行粒子層面的重構——這就是你們所稱的鈣質化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些結成的琺瑯質能直接受我的意識控制，不必跟隨我的動作來移動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想控制它們，既不需要無線電遙控，也不需要設置自動程式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它們就像我手腳的延伸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是說那批動力甲——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "動力甲只是動力甲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一小管銀色液體才是關鍵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它是動力甲的神經遞質，是將操控者的神經活動與這具機械聯繫起來的媒介。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像......施術單元？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它或許已經超越了一般施術單元的概念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這個解釋很直觀。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我想喘口氣......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，如果我的做法讓你感到不適的話，我向你道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......剛剛要不是博士朝我擺手，我的攻擊目標可未必是你的拳頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所幸我們足夠默契。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，接下來我需要去見一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "據我所知，他是這批實驗動力甲最初的使用者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想請你與Mechanist先生同行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g7_mainstreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看見他們去了大學附近的一家酒吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，女士。他們三個人都在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能猜到塞雷婭想去找誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們上周才剛去見過他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那傢伙？他不是在您面前信誓旦旦地說不會見任何萊茵生命的人嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞雷婭......她還算是萊茵生命的人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐怕連她自己都不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我們要不要阻止他們見面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很好奇，塞雷婭到底掌握了多少資訊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是時候和她聊聊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，還有......洛肯·威廉姆斯是哥倫比亞特里蒙理工大學畢業的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛肯·威廉姆斯......是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......時間過得可真快，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一次實驗事故，就足以令一顆學界新星墜入塵埃，從此無人知曉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論如何，塞雷婭還有萊茵生命總轄也畢業於這所學校。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哥倫比亞科技界的社交晚宴就像他們的校友聚會一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，早知道這麼熱鬧，我也該去這所學校待一段時間的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，說不定......現在去湊湊熱鬧也還不算太晚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g4_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "燃燒瓶只剩最後一個了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "扔出去！儘量扔遠一點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "撤！跟著我，往裡面跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼樣？都跟上來了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......領隊，我們的人都進來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怪物呢？有沒有跟上來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暫時沒有。瓶子還沒燒完，它們都圍上去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多謝各位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傷患們也都在這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫默醫生，接下來該怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "領隊，出去的門——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打不開了，這*粗口*的是怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生，是你關的門嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我是第一次進入這個實驗基地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烏比卡博士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實驗室的門是自動的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但它鎖上了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鎖上不是正好？你們不是很怕外面的銀色造物嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們怎麼知道你是想把怪物擋在外面，還是把我們關在裡面？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "搞不好這都是你們計畫好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我計畫好的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，這麼說，是我控制你們綁架了我自己？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別得意，你現在還在我們手裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩姆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "領隊，是你說的，我們都被這幾個做實驗的騙了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，別大聲說話——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫默醫生，你有沒有聽見......什麼聲音？窸窸窣窣的，就好像有東西在貼著地面滑行......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位，請不要停下來，也不要回頭看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "推開你們右手邊的第三道門吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "領隊，門真的能打開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要害怕，我會保護你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......一如既往。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g9_headquarter"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這是最新一批遞質的測試結果？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過還只是理論結果......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傳導效率提升了百分之一點七。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個月過去了，很大的突破。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們幹得非常出色。想要我給你們更多時間嗎？十天，還是二十天？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對、對不起！呃啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看你把這孩子嚇得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難怪常有人說，能量科主任的誇獎比批評更恐怖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是特地來跟我炫耀你的人緣的嗎，帕爾維斯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是路過而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可憐的孩子，你可以回實驗室了。我替你陪你們主任聊聊天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，果然是年輕人。腿腳真快，一下就沒影了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除了主任會議以外，難得見你走出實驗室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說吧，是什麼消息讓你追到了我這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......我想想，從哪裡說起呢？瞧瞧我這可憐的腦子，年紀上去了，再讓它轉起來就這麼費勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "省省吧，你的白頭髮是天生的，卡普里尼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想起來我要問什麼了——你知道繆爾賽思去哪了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她跟我打了個賭，要是她輸了，就欠我十盒生態科實驗農場出品的黑豆茶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_522_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打賭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕爾維斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_531_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩天前，她跟我說，你計畫在這個月之內，把主任頭銜從斐爾迪南·克魯尼這個名字後面撕掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g4_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......桑尼先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼不繼續往前走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是個錯誤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "錯誤？哪方面的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們不能跟著那個聲音走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個聲音......你是說弗蘭克斯主任？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "桑尼先生，弗蘭克斯主任是這間實驗室的主人。她比我和埃琳娜更熟悉這裡的構造，比如說哪個區域更加安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是這樣，我才不能相信她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒發現嗎？她在控制我們，她一直在這樣做！她一步步引導我們的行為，滲透我們的思想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她想讓我們全都心甘情願地鑽到她設下的牢籠裡去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......桑尼先生，請冷靜一些，情緒激動對你的病情沒有幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "離我遠一些！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奧利維亞！你沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拓荒者，我忍你們很久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不是奧利維亞非要救你們，我們剛才就把你們留在外面了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，誰又想跟你們進來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不明白......我真的不明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多蘿西明明對你們那麼好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g4_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你兒子的病好些了嗎，迪克？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不太好，弗蘭克斯主任......醫生說他最好要儘快動手術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你擔心費用問題？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，什麼都瞞不過您。我是為了給兒子治病才加入的拓荒隊，這還是我參與建設的第一個項目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "家裡早就沒什麼錢了，早知道我的孩子心臟有問題，我就不該浪費任何錢在礦石病的藥上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是沒希望了，但他還那麼小......嗚啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要急，迪克，我有辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，這是我認識的最好的心臟科醫生的聯繫方式。請立刻帶你兒子去找她吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......最好的心臟科醫生？在特里蒙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那一定非常貴......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生是我的大學同學。請告訴她，你是多蘿西·弗蘭克斯的朋友。看在我的面子上，她會給你打折的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真、真的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可別跟其他人說哦，減免手術費會影響這些好心的醫生在市場上的身價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您放心！這是我們之間的秘密！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我走啦！您一定要替我好好感謝您的朋友！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在一邊站那麼久幹什麼呀，咖啡都要涼了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "涼了好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說不定我想潑醒你的時候，就不會心疼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "心疼我，還是心疼咖啡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對我嬉皮笑臉可沒有用，弗蘭克斯主任。你再怎麼跟我扮可憐，我都不會借錢給你吃飯的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，那我下個月吃微波米飯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你呀......你是萊茵生命的主任，隔三差五來蹭我一個小研究員的飯，這傳出去會被人當笑話的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石技藝應用科是五個科研科裡最窮的啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我又不是斐爾迪南，總能拉來成堆的贊助，把自己從耳朵到尾巴都打扮得金光閃閃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......老闆的品味好歹還不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了好了，別想岔開話題。你那個同學我又不是不認識，她一聽是你介紹的，大概恨不得多要個百分之十的手術費。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正你為了你這些拓荒者朋友，多少錢都樂意掏。這麼好一個冤大頭，不欺負你欺負誰呀？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就笑吧，我真是拿你沒辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，我回實驗室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了拯救你的錢包，還是得早點做完這個實驗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g4_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她為你們做了這麼多，還要我也幫忙瞞著你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們這麼對她，不覺得很過分嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烏比卡博士，你是多蘿西·弗蘭克斯的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只看到了她想讓你看到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不知道......她的真實目的是多麼可怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g4_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "弗蘭克斯主任，我是特地來感謝您的！我兒子的手術很成功，醫生說他下個星期就能出院了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那太好了——迪克，你想不想回家看他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回、回家？您是說回城裡去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......我是感染者，按照規定，我並不能私自進入移動城市......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除非你們能得到一份新的工作合約，足以為你們支付那筆保險費。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迪克，眼下就有一個機會——一個能讓你擺脫既定命運的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要你簽下這份知情同意書，你就能回家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我當然......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，請不要著急答應。你有二十四小時的時間考慮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不會欺騙你們，也不想有所隱瞞——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最重要的注意事項我都幫你圈出來了，你一定要仔細看清楚那些風險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多蘿西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有任何搞不明白的地方，隨時來問我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迪克！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "領、領隊？你怎麼來了？你也是來報名參加......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......把這份知情同意書給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？不，不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒聽明白嗎？她是想把你變成關在籠子裡的實驗動物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......那又怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "領隊，弗蘭克斯主任說，我還有機會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“機會”這個詞語，我們有多久沒聽見了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我並不需要二十四小時。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了那個再次見到孩子的可能性，我連一分鐘都等不了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g4_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就這樣，她帶走了迪克。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不止迪克，還有艾倫、蓋爾、索菲亞......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她抓住了我們所有人的弱點。沒有人能對她說不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是多蘿西·弗蘭克斯的伎倆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些銀色的生物就是她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說那些銀色造物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它們明明......咳咳，你根本就不懂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩位，關於那些追著我們跑的物體，你們到底各自瞭解多少？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們一個說生物，一個說造物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我確定自己沒有聽錯。畢竟，在黎博利中，我們這一族的聽力一貫很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是猜的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這時候你們的意見倒是很一致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，無論你們眼裡的多蘿西到底是什麼形象，至少她眼下的確在幫我們逃命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先按照她的指示繼續轉移吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_108_silent_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許走廊那頭的追兵能再幫你們理一理思路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
